Vendored components, all under src/bq_context/, retain their original license
headers and are modified from the originals:

    config.py                 scope/tier handling refactored to remove module globals
    schemas.py                unchanged contract; result/shard models added alongside
    discovery_common.py       shared helpers now take an explicit TierContext
    context_cache/            cache is per-TierContext rather than a module global
    reranker/                 token accounting moved to a contextvars.ContextVar
    approaches/agent_*/       the six discovery approaches, repackaged
    corpus/                   upstream scripts/setup.py and scripts/cleanup.py
    ../experiments/           upstream examples/questions.json and GROUND_TRUTH.md

The benchmark harness, sharding, resume, retry, scoring pipeline, container,
and Vertex AI Pipelines orchestration in this repository are original work.
